{"seq":1,"slug":"serverless-monitoring","title":"Serverless 监控与可观测性","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/serverless-architecture/serverless-operations/serverless-monitoring","wordCount":1498,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"serverless-监控与可观测性\">Serverless 监控与可观测性</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>Serverless 应用的监控与可观测性面临独特挑战：函数实例生命周期短暂（毫秒到分钟级）、执行环境不可访问、分布式调用链跨越多个托管服务。传统的基于 Agent 的监控方案（如在服务器安装 Prometheus Node Exporter）在 Serverless 架构中不适用。需要采用无侵入或轻侵入的监控策略。</p>\n<p>Serverless 可观测性的三大支柱与传统架构相同——指标（Metrics）、日志（Logs）、追踪（Traces），但每个支柱的实现方式和关注点有所不同。核心关注的指标包括：调用次数、错误率、执行时长（P50/P95/P99）、冷启动比例、并发使用率和限流事件。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TB&#10;    subgraph Serverless可观测性&#10;        A[Lambda函数] --&gt; B[CloudWatch Metrics]&#10;        A --&gt; C[CloudWatch Logs]&#10;        A --&gt; D[X-Ray Traces]&#10;        E[API Gateway] --&gt; B&#10;        E --&gt; C&#10;        E --&gt; D&#10;        F[DynamoDB] --&gt; B&#10;        G[SQS] --&gt; B&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph 监控平台&#10;        B --&gt; H[CloudWatch Dashboard]&#10;        C --&gt; I[CloudWatch Insights]&#10;        D --&gt; J[X-Ray Service Map]&#10;        B --&gt; K[Datadog / New Relic]&#10;        C --&gt; K&#10;        D --&gt; K&#10;    end\">graph TB\n    subgraph Serverless可观测性\n        A[Lambda函数] --&gt; B[CloudWatch Metrics]\n        A --&gt; C[CloudWatch Logs]\n        A --&gt; D[X-Ray Traces]\n        E[API Gateway] --&gt; B\n        E --&gt; C\n        E --&gt; D\n        F[DynamoDB] --&gt; B\n        G[SQS] --&gt; B\n    end\n    subgraph 监控平台\n        B --&gt; H[CloudWatch Dashboard]\n        C --&gt; I[CloudWatch Insights]\n        D --&gt; J[X-Ray Service Map]\n        B --&gt; K[Datadog / New Relic]\n        C --&gt; K\n        D --&gt; K\n    end</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>监控维度</th>\n<th>关键指标</th>\n<th>告警阈值建议</th>\n<th>监控工具</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>可用性</td>\n<td>错误率（Error%）</td>\n<td>&gt;1% 告警</td>\n<td>CloudWatch Alarm</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>延迟</td>\n<td>Duration P99</td>\n<td>&gt;阈值 2x 告警</td>\n<td>CloudWatch + X-Ray</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>冷启动</td>\n<td>Init Duration</td>\n<td>&gt;500ms 关注</td>\n<td>CloudWatch Insights</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>并发</td>\n<td>ConcurrentExecutions</td>\n<td>&gt;80% 预留 告警</td>\n<td>CloudWatch Alarm</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>限流</td>\n<td>Throttles</td>\n<td>&gt;0 告警</td>\n<td>CloudWatch Alarm</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>迭代器</td>\n<td>IteratorAge (Kinesis/DDB)</td>\n<td>&gt;1 分钟 告警</td>\n<td>CloudWatch Alarm</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"cloudwatch-与-lambda-指标\">CloudWatch 与 Lambda 指标</h2><p>AWS CloudWatch 是 Lambda 监控的默认平台。Lambda 自动发送以下指标到 CloudWatch（无需任何配置）：</p>\n<p><strong>Invocations</strong>：函数被调用的次数。包括成功和失败的调用，但不包括被限流的请求。</p>\n<p><strong>Errors</strong>：导致函数错误的调用次数。包括函数代码抛出的异常、运行时错误和超时。区分于 Throttles（限流不算错误）。</p>\n<p><strong>Duration</strong>：函数执行时长（毫秒）。从 Handler 开始到返回响应的时间。不包括冷启动的 Init Duration。CloudWatch 自动计算 P50、P90、P99 百分位。</p>\n<p><strong>ConcurrentExecutions</strong>：同一时刻正在执行的函数实例数。是容量规划和并发配置的关键指标。</p>\n<p><strong>CloudWatch Logs Insights</strong> 是分析 Lambda 日志的利器。Lambda 的 REPORT 日志行包含丰富的执行元数据：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"REPORT RequestId: abc-123&#10;Duration: 45.67 ms&#10;Billed Duration: 46 ms&#10;Memory Size: 256 MB&#10;Max Memory Used: 128 MB&#10;Init Duration: 234.56 ms\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>REPORT RequestId: abc-123</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>Duration: 45.67 ms</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>Billed Duration: 46 ms</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>Memory Size: 256 MB</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>Max Memory Used: 128 MB</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>Init Duration: 234.56 ms</span></span></code></pre></div><p>使用 Logs Insights 查询冷启动模式：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"filter @type = &quot;REPORT&quot;&#10;| stats count() as invocations,&#10;        count(@initDuration) as coldStarts,&#10;        avg(@initDuration) as avgColdStart,&#10;        max(@initDuration) as maxColdStart,&#10;        avg(@duration) as avgDuration,&#10;        max(@maxMemoryUsed) / max(@memorySize) * 100 as memoryUtilization&#10;| by bin(1h)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">filter</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> @type </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"REPORT\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">| </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">stats</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> count</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">as</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> invocations,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        count</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(@initDuration) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">as</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> coldStarts,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        avg</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(@initDuration) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">as</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> avgColdStart,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        max</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(@initDuration) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">as</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> maxColdStart,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        avg</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(@duration) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">as</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> avgDuration,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        max</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(@maxMemoryUsed) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> max</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(@memorySize) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 100</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> as</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> memoryUtilization</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">| </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">by</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> bin(1h)</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>Embedded Metrics Format (EMF)</strong> 允许在 Lambda 日志中嵌入自定义指标，CloudWatch 自动提取为可查询的指标。无需调用 CloudWatch PutMetricData API，延迟更低、成本更低。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"import { MetricUnit, logMetrics } from &#39;@aws-lambda-powertools/metrics&#39;;&#10;&#10;const metrics = logMetrics({ namespace: &#39;OrderService&#39; });&#10;&#10;export const handler = async (event: unknown) =&gt; {&#10;  metrics.addMetric(&#39;OrderProcessed&#39;, MetricUnit.Count, 1);&#10;  metrics.addMetric(&#39;ProcessingTime&#39;, MetricUnit.Milliseconds, 45);&#10;  metrics.addDimension(&#39;Environment&#39;, &#39;production&#39;);&#10;  metrics.publishStoredMetrics();&#10;};\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { MetricUnit, logMetrics } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '@aws-lambda-powertools/metrics'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> metrics</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> logMetrics</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({ namespace: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'OrderService'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">export</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> const</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> handler</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> async</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">event</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> unknown</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  metrics.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">addMetric</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'OrderProcessed'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, MetricUnit.Count, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  metrics.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">addMetric</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'ProcessingTime'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, MetricUnit.Milliseconds, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">45</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  metrics.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">addDimension</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'Environment'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'production'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  metrics.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">publishStoredMetrics</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">};</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"分布式追踪与-x-ray\">分布式追踪与 X-Ray</h2><p>AWS X-Ray 是 Serverless 应用的分布式追踪服务。X-Ray 自动追踪 Lambda 函数的调用链，包括对 AWS SDK、HTTP 客户端和 SQL 数据库的下游调用。</p>\n<p><strong>Active Tracing</strong> 启用后，Lambda 自动为每次调用创建一个 Trace Segment。X-Ray SDK 或 ADOT（AWS Distro for OpenTelemetry）自动捕获 AWS SDK 调用、HTTP 请求和数据库查询作为 Subsegment。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    A[API Gateway] --&gt;|Trace Segment| B[Lambda: API Handler]&#10;    B --&gt;|Subsegment| C[DynamoDB: GetItem]&#10;    B --&gt;|Subsegment| D[SQS: SendMessage]&#10;    D --&gt;|Trace Segment| E[Lambda: Queue Processor]&#10;    E --&gt;|Subsegment| F[DynamoDB: PutItem]&#10;    E --&gt;|Subsegment| G[SNS: Publish]\">graph LR\n    A[API Gateway] --&gt;|Trace Segment| B[Lambda: API Handler]\n    B --&gt;|Subsegment| C[DynamoDB: GetItem]\n    B --&gt;|Subsegment| D[SQS: SendMessage]\n    D --&gt;|Trace Segment| E[Lambda: Queue Processor]\n    E --&gt;|Subsegment| F[DynamoDB: PutItem]\n    E --&gt;|Subsegment| G[SNS: Publish]</pre><p><strong>X-Ray Service Map</strong> 自动生成服务依赖关系图，显示每个服务节点的延迟、错误率和请求量。对于排查跨服务性能问题极为有效。</p>\n<p><strong>OpenTelemetry 集成</strong>：AWS 提供 ADOT Lambda Layer，将 OpenTelemetry SDK 集成到 Lambda 函数中。ADOT 同时发送 Traces 到 X-Ray 和第三方平台（Datadog、Honeycomb、Jaeger）。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"import { trace, SpanStatusCode } from &#39;@opentelemetry/api&#39;;&#10;&#10;const tracer = trace.getTracer(&#39;order-service&#39;);&#10;&#10;export const handler = async (event: unknown) =&gt; {&#10;  return tracer.startActiveSpan(&#39;processOrder&#39;, async (span) =&gt; {&#10;    try {&#10;      span.setAttribute(&#39;order.id&#39;, &#39;ORD-123&#39;);&#10;      const result = await processOrderLogic(event);&#10;      span.setStatus({ code: SpanStatusCode.OK });&#10;      return result;&#10;    } catch (error) {&#10;      span.setStatus({ code: SpanStatusCode.ERROR });&#10;      span.recordException(error as Error);&#10;      throw error;&#10;    } finally {&#10;      span.end();&#10;    }&#10;  });&#10;};\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { trace, SpanStatusCode } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '@opentelemetry/api'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> tracer</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> trace.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">getTracer</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'order-service'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">export</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> const</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> handler</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> async</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">event</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> unknown</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> tracer.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">startActiveSpan</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'processOrder'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">async</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">span</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    try</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      span.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">setAttribute</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'order.id'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'ORD-123'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> result</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> await</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> processOrderLogic</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(event);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      span.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">setStatus</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({ code: SpanStatusCode.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">OK</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> result;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">catch</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (error) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      span.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">setStatus</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({ code: SpanStatusCode.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">ERROR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      span.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">recordException</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(error </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">as</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Error</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      throw</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> error;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">finally</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      span.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">end</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">};</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>追踪方案</th>\n<th>自动检测</th>\n<th>自定义 Span</th>\n<th>成本</th>\n<th>集成广度</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>X-Ray Active Tracing</td>\n<td>Lambda + AWS SDK</td>\n<td>需 SDK</td>\n<td>$5/百万 Traces</td>\n<td>AWS 生态</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>ADOT Lambda Layer</td>\n<td>Lambda + HTTP + DB</td>\n<td>OpenTelemetry API</td>\n<td>X-Ray 费用 + 导出</td>\n<td>多厂商</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Datadog APM</td>\n<td>自动（Agent Layer）</td>\n<td>dd-trace SDK</td>\n<td>Datadog 订阅</td>\n<td>全面</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Lumigo</td>\n<td>全自动（无代码）</td>\n<td>不需要</td>\n<td>Lumigo 订阅</td>\n<td>Serverless 专注</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"lambda-powertools-工具链\">Lambda Powertools 工具链</h2><p>AWS Lambda Powertools 是一套 Serverless 最佳实践工具库，提供结构化日志、指标、追踪和幂等性等开箱即用的功能。支持 TypeScript、Python、Java 和 .NET。</p>\n<p><strong>Logger</strong>（结构化日志）：自动注入 Lambda 上下文（function_name、request_id、cold_start）到每条日志。支持日志采样（仅记录指定比例的 DEBUG 日志）。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"import { Logger } from &#39;@aws-lambda-powertools/logger&#39;;&#10;&#10;const logger = new Logger({&#10;  serviceName: &#39;order-service&#39;,&#10;  logLevel: &#39;INFO&#39;,&#10;  sampleRateValue: 0.1,&#10;});&#10;&#10;export const handler = async (event: unknown) =&gt; {&#10;  logger.addContext({ orderId: &#39;ORD-123&#39; });&#10;  logger.info(&#39;Processing order&#39;, { items: 3 });&#10;  logger.warn(&#39;Inventory low&#39;, { sku: &#39;PROD-001&#39;, remaining: 5 });&#10;};\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { Logger } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '@aws-lambda-powertools/logger'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> logger</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Logger</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  serviceName: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'order-service'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  logLevel: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'INFO'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  sampleRateValue: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">});</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">export</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> const</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> handler</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> async</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">event</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> unknown</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  logger.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">addContext</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({ orderId: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'ORD-123'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  logger.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">info</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'Processing order'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, { items: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  logger.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">warn</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'Inventory low'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, { sku: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'PROD-001'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, remaining: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">5</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">};</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>Tracer</strong>（追踪增强）：基于 X-Ray SDK 的封装，自动捕获 Lambda Handler 和方法级的追踪。支持注解（Annotation）和元数据（Metadata）添加。</p>\n<p><strong>Idempotency</strong>（幂等性）：基于 DynamoDB 的幂等性中间件。使用幂等键（从请求中提取）和过期时间防止重复处理。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Powertools 模块</th>\n<th>功能</th>\n<th>存储依赖</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Logger</td>\n<td>结构化日志、采样、上下文注入</td>\n<td>CloudWatch Logs</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Metrics</td>\n<td>自定义指标（EMF 格式）</td>\n<td>CloudWatch Metrics</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Tracer</td>\n<td>X-Ray 追踪增强</td>\n<td>X-Ray</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Idempotency</td>\n<td>幂等性保证</td>\n<td>DynamoDB</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Parameters</td>\n<td>参数/密钥缓存</td>\n<td>SSM/Secrets Manager</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Batch Processing</td>\n<td>批次部分失败处理</td>\n<td>SQS/Kinesis</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"第三方监控平台\">第三方监控平台</h2><p>对于生产级 Serverless 应用，云原生监控工具（CloudWatch + X-Ray）可能不足以满足复杂的监控需求。第三方平台提供更丰富的可视化、更智能的告警和跨云统一的监控体验。</p>\n<p><strong>Datadog Serverless Monitoring</strong> 提供 Lambda 函数的自动检测、端到端分布式追踪、实时日志关联和成本分析。Datadog Lambda Layer 自动注入追踪和指标收集。Serverless 专用视图展示冷启动比例、内存利用率、超时风险等 Serverless 特有指标。</p>\n<p><strong>Lumigo</strong> 是 Serverless 专注的可观测性平台。零代码自动追踪（通过 Lambda Layer 自动 hook SDK 调用）。Payload 可视化：自动捕获并展示每个函数调用的输入和输出（可选脱敏）。Timeline 视图：直观展示事件在多个函数间的传播路径。</p>\n<p><strong>Honeycomb</strong> 以高基数分析见长，适合排查复杂的分布式系统问题。BubbleUp 功能自动发现导致延迟或错误飙升的异常维度组合。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>平台</th>\n<th>自动检测</th>\n<th>成本可视化</th>\n<th>告警</th>\n<th>价格</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>CloudWatch + X-Ray</td>\n<td>基础</td>\n<td>无</td>\n<td>基础（Alarm）</td>\n<td>按用量</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Datadog</td>\n<td>全面</td>\n<td>Serverless Cost</td>\n<td>高级（ML 驱动）</td>\n<td>$5/函数/月起</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Lumigo</td>\n<td>零代码</td>\n<td>有</td>\n<td>中级</td>\n<td>$7.5/万次追踪</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Honeycomb</td>\n<td>ADOT 集成</td>\n<td>无</td>\n<td>高级（SLO 驱动）</td>\n<td>按事件量</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>Serverless 监控核心指标：错误率、Duration P99、冷启动比例、并发使用率、限流事件</li>\n<li>CloudWatch Logs Insights 查询 REPORT 日志分析冷启动和内存使用模式</li>\n<li>Embedded Metrics Format 在日志中嵌入自定义指标，零延迟零 API 调用</li>\n<li>X-Ray Active Tracing 自动追踪 Lambda 调用链，ADOT 支持多厂商导出</li>\n<li>Lambda Powertools 提供结构化日志、追踪、指标和幂等性的最佳实践封装</li>\n<li>生产环境推荐结合云原生工具和第三方平台（Datadog/Lumigo）实现全面可观测性</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"Serverless 监控与可观测性","id":"serverless-监控与可观测性"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"CloudWatch 与 Lambda 指标","id":"cloudwatch-与-lambda-指标"},{"level":2,"text":"分布式追踪与 X-Ray","id":"分布式追踪与-x-ray"},{"level":2,"text":"Lambda Powertools 工具链","id":"lambda-powertools-工具链"},{"level":2,"text":"第三方监控平台","id":"第三方监控平台"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"工作流编排与 Step Functions","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/serverless-architecture/serverless-patterns/workflow-orchestration"},"next":{"title":"Serverless 安全实践","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/serverless-architecture/serverless-operations/serverless-security"}}